  "hindi": "अग्नि को प्रज्वलित करता हुआ वह विरोधियों को जीत ले; जिसने ब्रह्म रचा है और जिसने हवि दी है वही बढ़े। जात के साथ वह जात से आगे बढ़ जाता है, जिस-जिस को ब्रह्मणस्पति अपना साथी बनाता है।",
  "english": "Kindling Agni, he shall overcome the hostile; he who has made the sacred word, whose oblation is given, shall thrive. With the born he rushes forth beyond the born, whomever Brahmaṇaspati makes his companion.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "jātena jātam ati is obscure (literally 'beyond the born with the born'); the reference of 'sa' to the refrain is by position only. vanuṣyataḥ read as 'the hostile'.",
  "confidence": "medium"
 },
